invariant: INV-13
file: session.c
catches: unit
reason: tlsi_fail sends the alert its failure chose and no longer records it,
  so ch_alert_sent reads 0 after a failure that sent decode_error or
  internal_error, and a caller's log of what ended the session is empty.
  bin/unit requires the description the failure sent.

--- old
        t->alert_sent = description;
        (void)tlsi_send_alert(t, 2, description);
--- new
        (void)tlsi_send_alert(t, 2, description);
